            - Resolution: added an "expkit modules exercised" section at the end of chapter.log that splits current usage (expkit.plot.style.apply_style) from planned usage when the chapter is fleshed out (expkit.power for guardrail family sizing, expkit.inference for the per-metric tests, expkit.inference.bayes plus a hierarchical PyMC model for the partial-pooling rewrite).
